{
    "title": "Fanatics: Shop NFL, NBA & More",
    "description": "Get rewarded for your fandom \u2014 with the new Fanatics App! \r\n\r\nFanatics is the ultimate destination for sports fans who live and breathe their favorite teams. We\u2019ve got everything you need to rep your fandom: \r\n\r\n-Officially Licensed Apparel: Deck yourself out in the latest jerseys, hats, shirts, jackets, and more from the NFL, NBA, NHL, MLB, and NCAA. \r\n-Exclusive Memorabilia: Own a piece of history with our collection of autographed memorabilia, from signed jerseys to game-used equipment. \r\n-Daily Games: Play our free games and earn FanCash with every win, plus a chance to win millions. \r\n\r\nWhy choose Fanatics? \r\nFree daily games. Cash prizes. Team gear. All in one app. \r\n\r\nFanatics Shop: \r\nShop over 250,000 products from your favorite teams and players. Football, basketball, baseball and more, delivered right to your doorstep.\r\n\r\nFREE TO PLAY GAMES \u2014 Free daily games and prizes! Play Fanatics free games daily for a chance to win up to $1M \r\n-Fanatics 5 Daily: Make five quick sports predictions each weekday and get FanCash when you go 5 for 5. For a weekly streak, win up to $250K. \r\n-Fanatics 5 Jackpot: Hit the jackpot every Saturday with up to $250K up for grabs. The bolder your choices, the bigger your reward. \r\n-Perfect 9: Tic-Tac-Toe meets bingo. Place your picks just right each Sunday, and you could win up to $500K. \r\n\r\nSPORTS TRIVIA\r\nQuadGoals: Test your sports knowledge on this daily trivia game and group athletes into four sets based on their connection\r\n\r\nWhether you\u2019re a die-hard fan or a casual enthusiast, Fanatics has something for everyone. Download now and start your journey to becoming the ultimate fan! \r\n\r\nREAL-TIME SCORES\r\nGet stats and real-time game updates from top leagues and view upcoming schedules.  Know what\u2019s happening right as it happens with Scores on the Fanatics app. This new feature includes MLB, NFL and all NCAA Football teams with real-time updates. You can easily view upcoming games and league calendars, and pin your teams to the top for easy access.\r\n\r\nEARN FANCASH\u2122 back on all eligible purchases \r\nDownload the new Fanatics App and start earning FanCash today. Every dollar of FanCash is a dollar to spend on fan gear - shop straight from the app. Or, spend it as Bonus Bets at Fanatics Sportsbook & Casino. \r\n\r\nWe have lots of exciting new features planned for the Fanatics app to improve your experience, so check the app frequently and see what\u2019s being added. \r\n\r\nApp access open to all. 21+ to play. No purchase necessary. US only. Void where prohibited. Terms apply.\r\n\r\nBonus Bets offer only available in states in which Fanatics Sportsbook operates; must be 21+ with an active Sportsbook account; See Fanatics Sportsbook app for details.\r\n\r\nFanCash subject to additional terms and conditions - see FanCash Policy for details.",
